-- Imported by ctors.l4: an enum this file declares, and a rule that returns a
-- constructor of it according to `taken now` of taken.l4 (smucclaw/l4-ide#1116).
-- The rule has to find `ajar` and `bolted` of its own file.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT taken

DECLARE Door IS ONE OF ajar, bolted

GIVETH A Door
`door` MEANS IF `taken now` THEN bolted ELSE ajar
